ns 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. April to May came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and so did September to October. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 138% of normal in April to May but only 45% in November to December. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 20869 at 56% of normal.</p>"}
